# Scope pin for THIS package. It must live here, not only in AitherOS/apps/.npmrc:
# npm resolves its project config at the PREFIX -- the nearest directory walking up
# from cwd that contains a package.json -- and this package HAS one, so the walk
# stops here and an ancestor .npmrc is never read. Measured 2026-09-01:
#   cd AitherOS/apps/packages/awkit -> npm config get @aitherium:registry -> undefined
#   cd AitherOS/apps                -> https://npm.pkg.github.com
# and `npm ci` here really did reach registry.npmjs.org:
#   404 Not Found - GET https://registry.npmjs.org/@aitherium%2fbead-space
# The CI publish lane runs `npm ci` with working-directory set to this package, so
# this file is the only pin on that path. Asserted by NPE005.
#
# Inert without NODE_AUTH_TOKEN; nothing in the monorepo resolves these from a
# registry today, because the siblings are linked locally.
@aitheros:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
@aitherium:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
